# Aclazotz scenarios). The trigger returns the card from the graveyard as a new object (CR 400.7): its back face, Temple of
# the Dead, a land and no longer a creature, tapped (CR 110.5b). Bot1 graveyard holds only the Black Lotus (no Aclazotz card); Bot2's holds the
# Bolts. Bot1 battlefield: 2 Moxen, Swamp and the Temple.

